ormFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck_precommit</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚠️ WARNING</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3912d073cafc4178a19d8792c413f364&pipelineRunId=8ece1857886d45c4baf27869edec5ede&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/3497/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-23 20:52:15] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-23T20:52:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-23T20:52:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176809475,"discussion_id":"b5f49a4009a580441e94c588c635578e792555b6","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本 PR 修复了 `math/polar/op_kernel/arch35/polar_simt.h` 中因变量类型为 `int32_t` 导致的大规模张量索引溢出引发的精度问题。核心改动是将 `PolarSimt::Process()` 及 `SimtPolarCompute()` 内核函数中与索引计算相关的局部变量从 `int32_t` 统一提升为 `int64_t`，包括 `blockIdx`、`idx`、`step`、`i`、`v`、`absBase`、`angleBase`、`yBase`、`vv`、`c`、`d` 等，确保在大维度/大元素数量的极坐标变换场景下乘法与加法运算不会因超出 int32 范围而截断，从而保证计算结果的正确性。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`Process()` 中 `blockIdx` 类型提升**: 将 `blockIdx` 从 `int32_t` 改为 `int64_t`，避免其与 `elementsPerCore_` / `formerCore_` 等 `int64_t` 成员进行乘法和比较运算时发生隐式截断。\n- **`SimtPolarCompute()` 局部索引变量类型提升**: 将线程索引 `idx`、步长 `step`、循环变量 `i`、全局偏移 `v`、多维基地址累加器（`absBase`、`angleBase`、`yBase`）以及维度拆解变量 `vv`、`c`、`d` 全部从 `int32_t` 改为 `int64_t`，防止多维 stride 乘法累加时溢出。\n- **输出索引计算安全保障**: `yBase` 升级为 `int64_t` 后，`2 * yBase` 等写入 `yGm` 的输出偏移计算在大索引场景下不再溢出。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T00:43:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T00:43:39+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176809908,"discussion_id":"2d2788f76490d142d5f261134c2409929dea310c","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T00:56:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T00:56:41+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176829229,"discussion_id":"4297d092491bd179b3fd17dad2db09e4303c945c","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-24T09:44:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T09:44:24+08:00","user":{"id":"68c1466222d8d17b10e260a3","login":"xiu_ling_wang","object_id":"68c1466222d8d17b10e260a3","name":"xiu_ling_wang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xiu_ling_wang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176829810,"discussion_id":"10e0ad3b1dab7a2af87fb493876412834da4ce15","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=8a35b745fcc549e589521ca7e9a22ad1&projectName=CANN'>8a35b745fcc549e589521ca7e9a22ad1</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/app